description.desc:
While in [Crimson Inscription], Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Unleash up to three Slashes forward with the Blood Axe, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Upon activating the second attack skill, Claret jumps backward and throws the Blood Axe. Perfect Dodge can be triggered during the retreat;
Upon activating the third attack skill, Claret performs continuous Slashes before leaping up and slamming down. During the continuous Slashes, Anti-Interrupt level is increased and DMG taken is reduced by 40%. Repeatedly press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to extend the duration of the continuous Slashes. When you stop pressing or release <IconMap:Icon_Normal>, Claret will immediately leap up and slam down. Perfect Dodge can be triggered during the leap. After successfully triggering a Perfect Dodge, press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the third segment of [Basic Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Star Forge];
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation.

While under [Crimson Inscription], after activating [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Sever Jin] or [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Burial Blood Onslaught] and successfully inflicting [Maim], press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Spin-jump and slam down with the blood axe, then Slash the target enemy, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>. The Perfect Dodge effect can be triggered during the jump;
After using this skill, press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Forge Star];
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> to activate:
Unleashes a powerful Counter with the blood axe against enemies ahead, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Does not exit <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Brand]</color> state during activation;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Sharpness is sufficient and not in [Crimson Engrave], press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Transforms the forging hammer into a blood axe and Slashes the target enemy, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
After using this skill, enters [Crimson Engrave] for 16 seconds. While off field, the duration no longer decreases. When Claret defeats an enemy, extends [Crimson Engrave] duration by 3 seconds, can be triggered up to once every 3 seconds;
Upon activating this skill, hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to skip the Slash and quickly ALT into [Special Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Sever Steel] and [Special Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Bloodbath Onslaught];
After using this skill, press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Forge Star];
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

While in [Crimson Inscription], press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Performs a powerful upward launch followed by a horizontal Slash, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
If the horizontal Slash hits an enemy with [Gash], it inflicts [Maim] on the target, dealing additional AoE <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Using this skill will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased during this skill. After successfully triggering [Maim], Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

While in [Crimson Inscription], during the launch of [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath · Sever Jin and Sunder Steel], hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Launches 3 consecutive horizontal Slashes forward, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Each horizontal Slash that hits an enemy with [Gash] inflicts [Maim] on the target, dealing additional AoE <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>. Up to 3 instances of [Maim] can be triggered consecutively within this skill, and the 3rd [Maim] has a higher Interrupt Level;
Will not exit <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased during this skill. After successfully triggering [Maim], Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Unleashes consecutive slashes on enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
While active, <color=#FFFFFF>Crimson Imprint</color> duration no longer decreases, and the <color=#FFFFFF>Crimson Imprint</color> state will not be exited;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Unleashes a series of slashes on enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
While active, <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> duration stops decreasing and will not exit <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> state;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When the active character is launched, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to activate:
Deals <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> after a <color=#FFFFFF>Defensive Assist</color> to activate:
dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Will not exit <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during this skill;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When you or the on-field Character is about to be hit by a Control Skill attack, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to activate:
Engage in a struggle with the monster. Upon success, neutralize the enemy's Control Skill;
While active, <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> duration no longer decreases;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
All DMG dealt by Claret's skills is Sharp DMG, which uses DEF as the DMG Multiplier. Sharp DMG accumulates Gash value. When the Gash value is full, the enemy enters [Gash]. [Gash] can stack up to 3 times. When [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Sever Gold and Sunder Iron] or [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath - Burial Blood Onslaught] hits an enemy in the [Gash] state, or when Claret defeats an enemy in the [Gash] state, one stack of [Gash] is consumed, triggering [Maim] and dealing one instance of AoE DMG;
When a critical hit is triggered, Laceration DMG replaces CRIT DMG for calculation. When CRIT Rate exceeds 100% and a critical hit is triggered, an additional Laceration check is performed, with the Laceration probability equal to the excess CRIT Rate. For every 1% of initial CRIT DMG Claret possesses, her initial CRIT Rate increases by 0.35%;
When Claret enters the battlefield, she recovers 60 Sharpness. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180 seconds.
